# Security

- Never commit `.env`, credentials JSON, API keys, or real passwords.
- Use `app/.env.example` as the template; real values only in `.env`.
- Do not place protected content in `public/` (bundled to `dist/` and may be served without API auth).
- Production requires explicit `JWT_SECRET` and bcrypt password hashes (no defaults).
- Prefer least-privilege IAM for GCS service accounts.

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES.md](../../app/documentation/ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES.md).
